      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-09-003\" hidden></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15767]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>1.2.</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>CHICKEN POX IN PREGNANCY:</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15768]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>3/1000.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15769]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Incubation period: </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15770]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>1 \u2013 3 weeks.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15771]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Infecti</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ous</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>: </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15772]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>48 hours before Rash till vesicles crust over (within 5 days).</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15773]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>Varicella Zoster Contact: </strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15774]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>1. Signify contact</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15775]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>Symptoms develops despite VZ IG or antiviral PEP</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Pt presents with chicken pox.</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>24 \u2013 48 hours.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Contact with GP</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Or midwife telephonic.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Avoid contact with </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>suspectable</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> individuals.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>Symptomatic treatment.</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>OFFER:</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Before 24 hours of rash</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Before 20 weeks.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Consider:</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>After 24 hours.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>After 20 weeks =&gt; symptomatic treatment only.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>      </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Avoid delivery for 7 days to reduce Neonatal risk.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>50% infection.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>23% clinical dis</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>ease</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Transfer </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>anti</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>bodies to fetus.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>less risk of </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>haemorrhage</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>, neonatal VZS.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Delivery within 7 days extremely hazardous.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Risk of transfer of virus with spinal needle.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Epidural is safe (as dura is not penetrated).</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Choose site with spared lesions.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>GA \u2013    es respiratory morbidity.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><strong>Infection before 28 weeks</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Inform risk of FVS \u2013 1%.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Refer to FMU @ (16 \u2013 20 weeks</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> or </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> after 5 weeks of infection).</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>USG</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Amino \u2013 PCR DNA</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>MRI if USG abnormal.</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15776]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>No past history.</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Uncertain status.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Tropical/ sub \u2013 tropical</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='