 class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Before rash in index case (if exposure is continuous).</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>If oral not tolerable or renal problem.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>Explain The woman </strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>that they are infectious.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>D-8 \u2013 28 \u2013 if VZ immunoglobulins are given.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>D-8 \u2013 21 \u2013 if not given.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>5.</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u> </u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u>Re \u2013 exposure:</u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>1.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> Check VZ</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>igG again if negative then give  Oral PEP or immunoglobulin</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>2.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> Re \u2013 dosing of VZ IG after 3 weeks.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>Postpartum vaccination:</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>2 doses 4 \u2013 8 weeks apart.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Avoid pregnancy for 28 days (live Attenuated)</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Avoid contact with suspect</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>a</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>ble individuals.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>2. past history of chicken pox.</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>99% predictive value</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Reassure, no Action.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>Significance of contact:</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>15 min in same room.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Face to face 5 min.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Contact in large ward.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Herperzoster.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>If on exposed axes.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>If in immune \u2013 compromised Pts (ed viral sheding).</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15777]\"><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15778]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15779]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15780]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15781]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15782]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 7pt'>Consider.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 7pt'>Oral Acyclovir. 800mg \u2013 5 times \u2013 7 days [857].</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15783]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15784]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15785]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15786]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15787]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 8pt'>If rash is within 1 \u2013 4 weeks of delivery</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15788]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15789]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15790]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15791]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm